      "editorial_subjects_unverified": "f+g; -f",
      "source_span_text": "ホモトピー集合 \\([EX, Y]\\) を考える.\\\\\n写像 $f,g:(\\Ex X,x_0)\\to(Y,y_0)$ に対し, \n\\(f+g,\\ -f: (EX,x_0)\\to (Y,y_0)\\) を, 次で定義する.\n\\[\n(f+g)(d_X(x,t)) :=\n\\begin{cases}\nf(d_X(x,2t)), & 0\\le t\\le \\tfrac12,\\\\[2mm]\ng(d_X(x,2t-1)), & \\tfrac12\\le t\\le 1,\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\\[\n(-f)(d_X(x, t)) := \nf(d_X(x, 1-t)).\n\\]",
      "source_file_sha256": "92cbfbb9b3ea9ba59a07450a5a8f16ec6b80715bb8b7d8f6eab442dd1a402605",
